{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TTS:Redux is a cross between <strong>Football</strong> and <strong>Speed Chess</strong>. With a focus on <strong>strategy</strong> &amp; <strong>tactics</strong>, test your skills against bots or friends and players around the world with teams of 5 to 10 players.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your team and players name and appearance, earn XP to upgrade your players and unlock new skills for your team as you climb the leaderboards. Use the physics based kicking system to customize your kicks and put your reflexes to the test with skill based goalkeepers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring full steam multiplayer integration and a completely new engine - the tactical soccer strategy game you've likely never heard of is back! TableTop Soccer: Redux is a completely redesigned version of the original game with a slew of new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/84f548a9f4ba908fad1058e4dd36f08a.poster.avif?t=1770225370\" width=800 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/84f548a9f4ba908fad1058e4dd36f08a.webm?t=1770225370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/84f548a9f4ba908fad1058e4dd36f08a.mp4?t=1770225370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Matches</strong> - Play against your friends and players all over the world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill based goalkeepers</strong> - Test your reflexes and skills to ruin your opponents day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up</strong> - Earn XP by playing games to level up your team and players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/da6a341ca1ef34999866f63088283568.poster.avif?t=1770225370\" width=800 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/da6a341ca1ef34999866f63088283568.webm?t=1770225370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/da6a341ca1ef34999866f63088283568.mp4?t=1770225370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Skills and Abilities</strong> - Enhance your players speed, kicking and tackling skills. Unlock powerful abilities to unleash unexpected plays on your opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics kicks</strong> - Get control over the ball with physics based kicking allowing you to customize how you kick the ball </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 10 players</strong> - Play from 5 a side games to full 10 player teams </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open pitch</strong> - No more grids on the pitch, move your players anywhere </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Camera</strong> - Control your view of the action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configurable Matches</strong> - Configure your matches total turns, duration, number of players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Players</strong> - Configure your players with 3 body types, 6 faces, 4 haircuts, 40+ hair and skin tones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Team</strong> - Configure your team with 4 colors and a personal formation to match your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full steam multiplayer integration</strong> - Steam invites, Steam lobbies (public/friends only) and chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Steam Deck Support</strong> - Game works great on the Steam Deck!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Steam Input Support</strong> - Game works great with any controller that works in steam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud</strong> - Automatically saves your team &amp; player configurations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Play</strong> - No internet required to play Solo games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Get on the pitch today and play some games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/7b44a5c43896e680208dd015985745a5.poster.avif?t=1770225370\" width=800 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/7b44a5c43896e680208dd015985745a5.webm?t=1770225370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/extras/7b44a5c43896e680208dd015985745a5.mp4?t=1770225370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1145910?t=1770225370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770225370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/e144cb02b3f733228b7f0e32dd24e5ec58b328b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770225370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145910/e144cb02b3f733228b7f0e32dd24e5ec58b328b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770225370","categories":[{"description":"